    <briefdescription>
<para>Displays Source and Binary side-by-side. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Relies on <ref refid="classAsmToSourceMapper" kindref="compound">AsmToSourceMapper</ref> annotations</para></listitem><listitem><para>has own (hacky) mechanism to map from a SourceCode location (cursor-location) to the according SgNode, and from there with <ref refid="classAsmToSourceMapper" kindref="compound">AsmToSourceMapper</ref> annotation to the binary TODO use mechanism here which is used in QRSourceBox </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
